  "instructions": [
    "Independently adjudicate all seven referred items and the second compensation-distinction copy from complete named source pages; read all seven affected whole records and each exact content change. Prior supported judgments are not evidence that these page bindings were right. Resolve whether the proposed page-local qualifiers preserve useful supported distinctions.",
    "Verify exact full v3-to-proposal/final diff, page coalescing and every dependent page array/relationship/task/facet. Retain all row IDs, meaning/stance/access/priority and relationships/tasks unless a new necessary correction is first reported. Treat continued sentence context precisely. Unchanged entity/evidence counts do not imply unchanged derived parent-page opportunities.",
    "Record actual prior-review reuse for demonstrably unchanged values, true continuing candidate-unseen context and post-freeze-referral provenance. Do not claim a fresh source-first or new whole-book review.",
    "If approved, finalize only permitted wrapper metadata into NEW successor/source/source-benchmark.v4.json. Author NEW current-schema successor/independent-review/source-benchmark-review.v3.json with exact ORIGINAL DRAFT to final approved_changes, inherited complete review proof and this narrow independently checked correction. Bind exact final/review bytes in a new exact-final-byte-assent and preserve exact before/final diffs, historical dispositions and input visibility.",
    "If any value remains wrong or review incomplete, report required revisions rather than approve. Do not edit any original/frozen/proposal bytes or either source state. Do not freeze, reactivate runtime, activate amendment, select a lock or inspect candidates. Root technical clearance is a distinct later step. Seal a manifest and report hashes."
  ],
